<section id="about" class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
  <SectionHeading title="About" />
  <div class="card">
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-pretty md:text-base">
      I'm a software engineer who likes owning a problem end to end, from the
      model to the hardware to the interface someone actually uses. At Lockheed
      Martin Space I lead C++ and Python flight software: link testing and
      telemetry, the embedded Linux it runs on, and on-board ML model serving on
      FPGAs. I also built the navigation stack for an autonomous rover. On the
      side I co-founded Nexus Odds, a sports betting analytics platform with
      1,290+ lifetime paying customers. I'm looking for software roles in
      autonomy, robotics and edge inference.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
